1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,970
We are going to be spending the next seven
days in this massive underground city.

2
00:00:04,004 --> 00:00:05,605
How does this place exist?

3
00:00:05,638 --> 00:00:08,408
Although it may look like
something straight out of the future,

4
00:00:08,441 --> 00:00:13,179
this city is built inside a mine,
dating back over a thousand years ago

5
00:00:13,213 --> 00:00:16,116
and with countless uncharted
tunnels and chambers.

6
00:00:16,149 --> 00:00:18,385
Who knows what horrors we’ll run into.

7
00:00:18,418 --> 00:00:20,920
These are the stairs
that descend into the city.

8
00:00:21,087 --> 00:00:22,322
How old are these stairs?

9
00:00:22,422 --> 00:00:23,256
Older than us.

10
00:00:23,323 --> 00:00:27,060
All right, now that we're down here.
Look at how high up the ceiling is.

11
00:00:28,094 --> 00:00:32,766
We are 400ft underground right now
and somehow this village just exists.

12
00:00:32,799 --> 00:00:33,867
This is nuts.

13
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:36,770
During World War Two, when
Romania was getting bombed,

14
00:00:36,803 --> 00:00:38,304
thousands of people would hide here.

15
00:00:38,338 --> 00:00:40,140
And now just a bunch
of YouTubers live here.

16
00:00:40,173 --> 00:00:42,675
And soon enough, we found a
solid place to spend the night.

17
00:00:42,709 --> 00:00:43,943
I think we should camp here.

18
00:00:43,943 --> 00:00:44,611
You're the boss.

19
00:00:44,677 --> 00:00:46,312
Our stuff is all
the way up there.

20
00:00:46,346 --> 00:00:49,182
So with home base decided,
we went up to grab our bags

21
00:00:49,182 --> 00:00:51,151
and using all our
collective brainpower,

22
00:00:51,184 --> 00:00:53,620
we discovered the best way
to get them down to camp.

23
00:00:55,155 --> 00:00:55,989
Oh! That's awesome.

24
00:00:56,022 --> 00:00:57,323
That’s dead on!

25
00:00:59,492 --> 00:01:01,694
We just finished fishing
everything out of the water

26
00:01:02,495 --> 00:01:05,398
Our food for the challenge
consists of bagged food,

27
00:01:05,432 --> 00:01:06,866
and we each brought
a personal bag.

28
00:01:06,866 --> 00:01:07,967
What's in yours Karl?

29
00:01:08,802 --> 00:01:10,003
Let's look at somebody else's.

30
00:01:10,036 --> 00:01:10,770
You get the point.

31
00:01:10,804 --> 00:01:12,505
You guys want to know
what the craziest part is?

32
00:01:12,505 --> 00:01:14,507
We've barely seen any
of this underground city.

33
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:17,043
The walls that surround us
are hiding a bunch of tunnels.

34
00:01:17,077 --> 00:01:19,813
There's even a chamber as
massive as the one we’re in now.

35
00:01:19,813 --> 00:01:20,313
Where?

36
00:01:20,346 --> 00:01:20,814
What?

37
00:01:20,847 --> 00:01:23,750
However, what these guys
don't know is that every single day

38
00:01:23,783 --> 00:01:26,820
I'm bringing a famous YouTuber
to help us explore these tunnels.

39
00:01:26,853 --> 00:01:30,690
But the more YouTubers that joined us,
the deeper this city would fall into chaos.

40
00:01:31,357 --> 00:01:32,725
You just got here, bro.

41
00:01:32,759 --> 00:01:34,260
We're going to bed
at a reasonable hour

42
00:01:34,294 --> 00:01:36,296
because I have a big
surprise in the morning.

43
00:01:36,329 --> 00:01:37,163
That's ominous

44
00:01:37,197 --> 00:01:42,335
Day one in the underground city was a
success. We'll see you in the morning.

45
00:01:42,569 --> 00:01:44,204
Good morning.

46
00:01:44,237 --> 00:01:45,338
bro why?

47
00:01:45,371 --> 00:01:46,372
It's gonna be a great day.

48
00:01:46,506 --> 00:01:50,343
First thing in the morning, I took everyone
to the elevator for my big announcement.

49
00:01:50,443 --> 00:01:55,715
Starting today, every single morning, a
famous YouTuber is going to be joining us.

50
00:01:55,748 --> 00:01:58,852
Our surprise guest, coming
down from the surface

51
00:02:00,253 --> 00:02:02,021
is JiDion!

52
00:02:04,691 --> 00:02:07,393
Welcome to the underground city.

53
00:02:08,461 --> 00:02:09,629
This is legit a city.

54
00:02:10,029 --> 00:02:11,631
There's even a Ferris wheel here.

55
00:02:11,664 --> 00:02:12,966
Yeah, but that's not all.

56
00:02:13,032 --> 00:02:14,968
So we have not been up these stairs yet,

57
00:02:15,101 --> 00:02:18,638
and is not that the most ominous
stairs you've ever seen in your life?

58
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,074
Boys, come up here.

59
00:02:21,107 --> 00:02:22,575
Lazarbeam has a fear of heights.

60
00:02:22,609 --> 00:02:23,776
Why are we doing this to me?

61
00:02:23,776 --> 00:02:25,912
Today we're conquering
your fear of heights.

62
00:02:25,945 --> 00:02:27,080
Oh my gosh.

63
00:02:27,714 --> 00:02:28,815
How are you so calm?

64
00:02:28,848 --> 00:02:31,251
If I'm gonna die, I'm gonna
die, I'm not gonna worry about it.

65
00:02:31,351 --> 00:02:32,185
Oh, God.

66
00:02:33,019 --> 00:02:36,055
All right, we have a
lantern to go exploring.

67
00:02:36,089 --> 00:02:37,357
I feel so much safer now.

68
00:02:37,390 --> 00:02:38,725
Well, don't get too comfortable,

69
00:02:38,725 --> 00:02:41,661
because just around the corner,
we found this menacing door.

70
00:02:41,694 --> 00:02:43,263
Access forbidden.

71
00:02:45,798 --> 00:02:46,766
Oh heck no

72
00:02:48,801 --> 00:02:49,936
- Wait.
- I'll check it out.

73
00:02:49,936 --> 00:02:51,237
Oh no, no, no.

74
00:02:51,871 --> 00:02:52,939
Alright guys, looks safe!

75
00:02:52,939 --> 00:02:55,775
Are we sure there's not like people
living down here or something?

76
00:02:55,808 --> 00:02:57,243
Only one way to find out.

77
00:02:57,277 --> 00:03:00,146
This does feel like
a very haunted area.

78
00:03:00,947 --> 00:03:01,814
Oh, no.

79
00:03:02,649 --> 00:03:06,452
These boards either held up a sign that
said don't enter that someone ripped down

80
00:03:06,486 --> 00:03:07,086
It definitely did.

81
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,688
Or they're just
here for decoration.

82
00:03:08,688 --> 00:03:10,490
I think they're here for
decoration. Follow me!

83
00:03:10,523 --> 00:03:11,791
This doesn’t look creepy at all.

84
00:03:11,858 --> 00:03:15,562
Hey everyone, for 1000 years they've
harvested salt from the salt mine.

85
00:03:15,595 --> 00:03:18,264
This is a dark chocolate
sea salt Feastables bar.

86
00:03:18,264 --> 00:03:20,833
Hear me out. What if we put
more salt on our sea salt bar?

87
00:03:20,833 --> 00:03:22,569
Straight from the source.

88
00:03:22,569 --> 00:03:23,603
That's so good.

89
00:03:24,437 --> 00:03:25,271
It tastes really good.

90
00:03:25,305 --> 00:03:27,273
And for climbing
multiple sets of stairs.

91
00:03:27,307 --> 00:03:28,608
Where is this leading us?

92
00:03:28,641 --> 00:03:29,776
I'm not sure.

93
00:03:29,809 --> 00:03:31,110
Going where we
probably shouldn't.

94
00:03:31,144 --> 00:03:33,313
Wait. What does
this say? Do not pass.

95
00:03:33,346 --> 00:03:34,280
What does that mean?

96
00:03:34,314 --> 00:03:35,281
Karl, put your hands like this.

97
00:03:35,281 --> 00:03:36,149
Dude.

98
00:03:36,216 --> 00:03:38,151
We probably can't
put this on camera.

99
00:03:38,218 --> 00:03:40,086
As eerie as these tunnels were,

100
00:03:40,119 --> 00:03:44,123
the creepiest were still yet to come as
we ventured back to camp for the night.

101
00:03:44,157 --> 00:03:47,160
As you can see, 
JiDion joined us in the bed-ring.

102
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:49,996
Tomorrow's gonna be a fun day.
We have a super special guest.

103
00:03:50,029 --> 00:03:52,999
We’ll see you in the morning.

104
00:03:53,566 --> 00:03:56,536
Alright. It's the start of day three,
and you know what that means.

105
00:03:56,569 --> 00:04:00,840
Let's go see who the special
guest of the day is. Send them down!

106
00:04:00,873 --> 00:04:02,275
I see a shadow! 
There he is!

107
00:04:02,308 --> 00:04:03,009
Is it Kai?

108
00:04:03,042 --> 00:04:04,177
Maybe it’s Speed?

109
00:04:04,644 --> 00:04:05,645
I see two shadows!

110
00:04:05,712 --> 00:04:06,713
There's two of them?!

111
00:04:06,713 --> 00:04:08,815
Today the two guests are!

112
00:04:09,916 --> 00:04:11,017
Sam and Colby!

113
00:04:11,050 --> 00:04:12,252
Yeah!

114
00:04:14,254 --> 00:04:15,255
If you don't know already,

115
00:04:15,255 --> 00:04:18,958
Sam and Colby specialize in exploring
abandoned and haunted places,

116
00:04:18,992 --> 00:04:20,994
so it'll be interesting
to see what they think

117
00:04:21,027 --> 00:04:23,329
when we explore this
1000 year old tunnel system.

118
00:04:23,363 --> 00:04:23,930
Are we going?

119
00:04:23,963 --> 00:04:25,131
See how high the ceiling is?

120
00:04:25,164 --> 00:04:27,467
Well apparently, there's like a
window where you can look down

121
00:04:27,533 --> 00:04:30,670
and I want to see Lannan’s reaction
because he's terrified of heights.

122
00:04:32,605 --> 00:04:35,141
Meanwhile, the others are
going to upgrade our base camp.

123
00:04:35,275 --> 00:04:38,878
Alright, alright, you’ll do stuff here,
and then you'll do stuff over there.

124
00:04:38,911 --> 00:04:40,346
Oh I get it, you're
a supervisor.

125
00:04:40,380 --> 00:04:41,080
Yeah!

126
00:04:41,114 --> 00:04:43,216
Yeah. Has no clue what's
going on and tells us what to do.

127
00:04:43,249 --> 00:04:44,384
Alright, let's get to
work. Let's get to work.

128
00:04:44,450 --> 00:04:45,985
As we went deeper than before,

129
00:04:46,019 --> 00:04:49,322
I never could have guessed how
sketchy exploring these tunnels would get.

130
00:04:52,258 --> 00:04:55,194
I think Sam and Colby should lead the
way because they have more experience

131
00:04:55,228 --> 00:04:56,529
We love creepy holes, you know?

132
00:04:56,529 --> 00:04:57,196
That makes sense.

133
00:04:57,196 --> 00:04:57,930
Yeah, lead the way.

134
00:04:58,064 --> 00:04:59,399
You're getting farther
and farther away.

135
00:04:59,432 --> 00:05:00,600
I'm right behind you.

136
00:05:00,633 --> 00:05:01,601
Oh, we got two ways.

137
00:05:01,634 --> 00:05:02,635
This way.

138
00:05:05,872 --> 00:05:06,673
Karl!

139
00:05:08,041 --> 00:05:09,776
I got Colby so good

140
00:05:09,809 --> 00:05:10,843
That scared the crap out of him.

141
00:05:10,877 --> 00:05:15,315
Anyway, we kept walking until we eventually
came across this ominous staircase.

142
00:05:15,315 --> 00:05:16,449
This is sketch!

143
00:05:17,350 --> 00:05:19,519
There's just a
gigantic cross up here.

144
00:05:19,552 --> 00:05:20,687
Wait wait wait, really?

145
00:05:20,753 --> 00:05:22,055
What do we make of this cross?

146
00:05:22,055 --> 00:05:25,258
The one thing that we
know about these salt mines

147
00:05:25,291 --> 00:05:29,262
is there is a legend that
there was one spirit seen,

148
00:05:29,295 --> 00:05:31,998
and they created an
altar at that location

149
00:05:32,031 --> 00:05:34,467
because it's where the
hauntings are, this is the spot.

150
00:05:34,967 --> 00:05:36,769
That sounds awesome!
Let's keep going!

151
00:05:38,871 --> 00:05:41,407
Yo, that’s the hole
that leads to the camp.

152
00:05:41,474 --> 00:05:42,542
Oh, is that the hole?

153
00:05:42,608 --> 00:05:44,377
I feel like there's a
fence for a reason.

154
00:05:44,410 --> 00:05:45,178
Should I go over there?

155
00:05:46,112 --> 00:05:47,380
I’ll watch from here.

156
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,015
Dude, I can see our camp!

157
00:05:49,248 --> 00:05:50,249
Look!

158
00:05:54,954 --> 00:05:56,222
Shawn!

159
00:05:56,656 --> 00:05:58,558
Oh, they're way up above us.

160
00:05:58,624 --> 00:05:59,492
How's it going?

161
00:05:59,492 --> 00:06:01,394
We have a shower boys!

162
00:06:01,627 --> 00:06:02,829
They just yelled
we have a shower.

163
00:06:03,463 --> 00:06:04,364
How did you do that?

164
00:06:04,430 --> 00:06:08,167
First we'll make a shower head out of
the cap and then we'll hang our water jug.

165
00:06:08,501 --> 00:06:09,969
Lannan! Come check this out!

166
00:06:11,504 --> 00:06:12,205
I'm coming.

167
00:06:12,238 --> 00:06:14,340
Lannan, you can't be
this afraid of heights.

168
00:06:14,807 --> 00:06:16,876
I'm coming bro, I'm
coming. This is okay.

169
00:06:17,577 --> 00:06:19,712
No, no, no.
No one touch me.

170
00:06:19,746 --> 00:06:21,180
We're overcoming our fears.

171
00:06:21,247 --> 00:06:23,583
Having now explored
50% of the mines

172
00:06:23,583 --> 00:06:25,985
and with a way to
wash our reeking bodies,

173
00:06:26,052 --> 00:06:28,321
this underground
city was finally thriving.

174
00:06:28,354 --> 00:06:29,622
But there was still plenty to do

175
00:06:29,655 --> 00:06:31,924
because by the next
morning, we had to welcome

176
00:06:31,958 --> 00:06:35,995
our day four special guest
coming down the elevator!

177
00:06:35,995 --> 00:06:36,963
Wait they’re short!

178
00:06:36,963 --> 00:06:39,565
Is the biggest Twitch streamer
on the planet,

179
00:06:40,333 --> 00:06:41,734
Kai Cenat!

180
00:06:44,537 --> 00:06:47,673
Welcome to the underground city!

181
00:06:50,443 --> 00:06:53,746
Alright Kai I want you to jump
and stomp as loud as you can.

182
00:06:57,950 --> 00:06:59,519
What the heck?

183
00:06:59,552 --> 00:07:01,821
Kai now that you’re
here, we have a big family.

184
00:07:04,056 --> 00:07:06,325
And nothing's gonna
get between any of us.

185
00:07:08,060 --> 00:07:08,995
Is that foreshadowing?

186
00:07:09,162 --> 00:07:10,830
Bro, you just got here!

187
00:07:11,564 --> 00:07:12,265
Oh God!

188
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:16,969
Kai, I specifically saved
one secret tunnel for you.

189
00:07:17,003 --> 00:07:17,770
So let’s go explore it!

190
00:07:17,770 --> 00:07:20,740
So using these boats, we
crossed the underground lake.

191
00:07:20,807 --> 00:07:23,342
That's right, a lake,
that's underground.

192
00:07:23,443 --> 00:07:27,013
And on the other side, our next set of
tunnels was through this hole in the wall.

193
00:07:27,079 --> 00:07:28,214
Karl should go first.

194
00:07:28,247 --> 00:07:28,881
I'll go first.

195
00:07:29,882 --> 00:07:30,883
There's a door in the hole.

196
00:07:30,917 --> 00:07:31,818
What is behind that door?

197
00:07:31,851 --> 00:07:33,753
We got to get in
there, that is awesome.

198
00:07:33,753 --> 00:07:36,289
You got it, you got it, you got
it, you got it. Oh my God.

199
00:07:36,489 --> 00:07:39,459
So after a boost from Shawn
we were ready to explore

200
00:07:39,725 --> 00:07:41,160
- See you Shawn!
- Bye Shawn!

201
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:44,263
I see this in movies all the time. When
we get past the door, we're gonna die.

202
00:07:44,297 --> 00:07:45,064
What's the game plan?

203
00:07:45,064 --> 00:07:47,300
You gotta go straight,
then you gotta make a left,

204
00:07:47,333 --> 00:07:50,303
then right is always right,
so make that U-turn half circle

205
00:07:50,303 --> 00:07:52,104
opposite of your left hand side.

206
00:07:52,104 --> 00:07:55,341
But once you go straight,
you take five steps back. Okay?

207
00:07:55,575 --> 00:07:58,110
So after trekking through
this sketchy tunnel...

208
00:07:59,111 --> 00:07:59,979
What happened? What?

209
00:07:59,979 --> 00:08:02,682
It literally just opened
up into a giant dark void.

210
00:08:02,715 --> 00:08:05,818
They told me there was another
cavern just as big as the other one,

211
00:08:05,885 --> 00:08:09,055
so I thought it'd be fun if we
brought the world's brightest flashlight.

212
00:08:10,990 --> 00:08:12,425
- Dude
- What?

213
00:08:15,094 --> 00:08:16,095
This is unreal!

214
00:08:16,195 --> 00:08:17,830
Hey wait, be careful
there are ledges here

215
00:08:17,830 --> 00:08:18,531
Yeah I'm gonna jump.

216
00:08:18,531 --> 00:08:19,332
Wait you're gonna jump?

217
00:08:19,432 --> 00:08:20,766
Bye guys!

218
00:08:20,833 --> 00:08:21,901
Kai where are you going?

219
00:08:22,001 --> 00:08:22,702
Bye!

220
00:08:22,702 --> 00:08:23,736
If it’s safe for him...

221
00:08:24,837 --> 00:08:25,805
Yeah this is cool!

222
00:08:25,838 --> 00:08:26,806
- Together!
- Together!

223
00:08:29,375 --> 00:08:30,710
Hello!

224
00:08:32,345 --> 00:08:33,746
It sounds like I’m over there!

225
00:08:33,779 --> 00:08:35,681
Now they're all down there
in the middle of the cavern,

226
00:08:35,715 --> 00:08:37,717
I’m gonna turn the
flashlight off to scare them.

227
00:08:37,884 --> 00:08:38,584
Ready?

228
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:42,255
- Hey!
- What we doing.

229
00:08:42,688 --> 00:08:44,223
Come on! Come on!

230
00:08:44,824 --> 00:08:45,625
They're leaving us.

231
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:49,695
Hurry! Come on, come on, come on.

232
00:08:49,729 --> 00:08:50,730
Come on, come on, come on.

233
00:08:52,732 --> 00:08:53,399
Lock them in!

234
00:08:53,466 --> 00:08:54,567
He's leaving us!

235
00:08:54,634 --> 00:08:55,568
Oh God!

236
00:08:56,302 --> 00:08:57,336
Later nerds!

237
00:08:58,871 --> 00:08:59,672
Open it!

238
00:09:00,606 --> 00:09:01,641
You’re gonna break Karl’s arm!

239
00:09:02,308 --> 00:09:03,776
Pull! Pull!

240
00:09:03,876 --> 00:09:04,677
I’m letting go.

241
00:09:05,678 --> 00:09:06,312
Hey man!

242
00:09:06,345 --> 00:09:06,846
What?

243
00:09:06,879 --> 00:09:07,613
What’s what?

244
00:09:07,647 --> 00:09:08,781
Is y’all trying to leave us?

245
00:09:08,881 --> 00:09:09,248
No!

246
00:09:09,315 --> 00:09:10,483
I heard you say “later losers”

247
00:09:10,917 --> 00:09:11,417
Who?

248
00:09:11,417 --> 00:09:12,051
You!

249
00:09:12,084 --> 00:09:12,785
No...

250
00:09:12,818 --> 00:09:14,353
He tried to trap us
in there for a night.

251
00:09:14,921 --> 00:09:16,088
No no, you can stay down there.

252
00:09:16,122 --> 00:09:19,191
So with tensions running high
after a long day of exploring,

253
00:09:19,225 --> 00:09:22,461
we decided to turn in for the night,
but Karl was about to strike again

254
00:09:22,495 --> 00:09:24,397
and this time with JiDion’s help.

255
00:09:24,397 --> 00:09:25,765
We're going to prank
the rest of the team.

256
